   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">13 April 2011, Dapaong - Onion vendors at the main market.&#xA;&#xA;FAO Project GCP/TOG/016/EC - Reinforcement of food security bases for vulnerable households in Togo. Objective: to contribute to the reinforcement of food security of vulnerable households (households affected by soaring food prices for basic foodstuffs) in Togo through the improvement of domestic grain and cereal production capacity.&#xA;</rdf:li>
